  "voice": {
    "post_text": [
      "Visit our Greensboro store at 1410 Westover Terrace for outdoor gear, expert advice, and dog-friendly shopping! Join us for events and community activities.",
      "Stop in this week to send a message to Chapel Hill staff who were impacted by Chantal. We appreciate all the messages and will send a care package to help as we navigate the next steps in recovery efforts. We are so grateful to everyone who reached out and offered kindness.\n\nIn order to further support staff, please shop online with us and check your inbox for the Mule Mail for updates.\n\nThank you all!"
    ],
